{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261127/photo/bkn-20261127094244322-1127_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261127103001\"/><p>救援人員趕往現場處理傷者。(張開裕攝)</p><p>青衣發生撞船意外。今日(27日)早上9時25分，據報一艘船隻在青衣路對開對開海域撞及不明大型金屬物品。船上至少24人受傷，其中4人較為嚴重，救援人員正趕往現場處理傷者。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T02:43:54.960859+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T01:42:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T02:37:30.103872+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T02:37:30.103872+00:00","content_hash":"09da7bb2772282b4f3e0b066ce940fd9220a1fdd6d99f2a25cbaccc36a852283","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}